      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " The gods themselves do not know where the divine begins — because the divine does not begin. Osho says this is the deepest riddle of existence: the source cannot be seen as an object, because every seer is inside it. You cannot stand outside the whole and take a photograph. The mind, which knows by dividing, cannot know the undivided; it can only surrender to it. And surrender — not knowledge — is the real beginning."]
