      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " The seers were born of thought, not of womb — myth speaking the truth that consciousness precedes matter. Osho says the lineage of the universe is not blood but vision: the world we live in was first dreamed, then built. Every civilisation, every family, every man is the child of some inner sage — some idea he inherited without examining. The revolution of the Gita is to trace the lineage back: beyond the seven sages, beyond the first dream, stands the dreamer."]
